{"4014130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyber Planet", "steam_appid": 4014130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5103690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014130/extras/8a6cb69893136238168da5a5edae7c4b.poster.avif?t=1786589945\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014130/extras/8a6cb69893136238168da5a5edae7c4b.webm?t=1786589945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014130/extras/8a6cb69893136238168da5a5edae7c4b.mp4?t=1786589945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Planet is a speed-focused action platformer centered around a highly in-depth dash system. Master multiple dash variations, chain precise movements together, and push your momentum to the limit as you speed through challenging levels designed to punish mistakes and reward skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber Planet can feel frustrating and demanding. But once you truly master the controls, the game transforms into a smooth, fast, and deeply satisfying experience. You'll realize levels that initially took you over an hour to complete can be cleared in just seconds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTABLE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Game Mode </strong>- A massive, highly detailed map so large it had to be split into <strong>four unique scenes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Mode </strong>- 15+ extra challenge levels designed to truly test your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> - A robust online leaderboard system with 